      "description": "The central blue hollow ladder (make_duplex at y=0, x=0.55..6.0) is never registered and carries no polarity labels or parental annotation. Because both blue templates run essentially full width (x=-5.8..5.9) at y=+/-1.35 and never converge into it, the ladder reads as an ADDITIONAL third double-stranded DNA floating between two already-separated strands rather than the unreplicated parental duplex ahead of the fork. Identity cannot be confirmed from the picture: parental duplex vs. extra DNA is UNCERTAIN.",
